{common:block}
<p>The {app:construct 'start'/} / {app:construct 'end'/} & {app:construct 'else'/}  constructs act on the number of occurences.</p>
<p>The {app:tag 'first'/} & {app:tag 'last'/} tags are part of the special <a href="{$padHost}manual/?pages/properties">Properties</a> tags.</p>
</p>
{/common:block}

{common:table}

{common:demo}

{pad:data 'myArray'}
  [1,2,3]
{/pad:data}

{/common:demo}{common:demo}

{data:myArray}

  <table border="1">
    <tr> <td> Before the first occurrence </td> </tr>
    @start@
      <tr> <td> For every occurence </td> </tr>
    @end@
    <tr> <td> After the last occurrence </td> </tr>
  </table>

@else@

  <p> No occurences at all </p>

{/data:myArray}

{/common:demo}{common:demo}

{data:myArray}

  {property:first}
    <table border="1">
      <tr> <td> Before the first occurrence </td> </tr>
  {/property:first}
      <tr> <td> For every occurence </td> </tr>
  {property:last}
      <tr> <td> After the last occurrence </td> </tr>
    </table>
  {/property:last}

@else@

  <p> No occurences at all </p>

{/data:myArray}

{/common:demo}{common:demo}

{pad:count 'myArray'}

  <table border="1">
    <tr> <td> Before the first occurrence </td> </tr>
  {data:myArray}
    <tr> <td> For every occurence </td> </tr>
  {/data:myArray}
    <tr> <td> After the last occurrence </td> </tr>
  </table>

@else@

  <p> No occurences at all </p>

{/pad:count}

{/common:demo}

{/common:table}

<br><hr><br>

{common:block}
<p>Now the same code with an empty array</p>
<p>The {pad:open/}pad:else{pad:close/} construct comes active when there are zero occurences for a PAD tag.</p>
{/common:block}

{common:table}

{common:demo}

{pad:data 'myArray'}
 []
{/pad:data}

{/common:demo}{common:demo}

{data:myArray}

  <table border="1">
    <tr> <td> Before the first occurrence </td> </tr>
    @start@
      <tr> <td> For every occurence </td> </tr>
    @end@
    <tr> <td> After the last occurrence </td> </tr>
  </table>

@else@

  <p> No occurences at all </p>

{/data:myArray}

{/common:demo}{common:demo}

{data:myArray}

  {property:first}
    <table border="1">
      <tr> <td> Before the first occurrence </td> </tr>
  {/property:first}
      <tr> <td> For every occurence </td> </tr>
  {property:last}
      <tr> <td> After the last occurrence </td> </tr>
    </table>
  {/property:last}

@else@

  <p> No occurences at all </p>

{/data:myArray}

{/common:demo}{common:demo}

{pad:count 'myArray'}

  <table border="1">
    <tr> <td> Before the first occurrence </td> </tr>
  {data:myArray}
    <tr> <td> For every occurence </td> </tr>
  {/data:myArray}
    <tr> <td> After the last occurrence </td> </tr>
  </table>

@else@

  <p> No occurences at all </p>

{/pad:count}

{/common:demo}

{/common:table}
